# Proxima — optional configuration
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Everything works without these; they upgrade
# specific parts from representative to fully-live.

# 8004scan Pro API key (free for hackathon participants).
# With it, the agent list is read live from ERC-8004 on BSC instead of the
# labelled demo dataset. Apply at https://8004scan.io/developers
# NOTE: this is a client-side (VITE_) var, so it ships in the bundle — only
# use a key scoped/rate-limited for public use, or move this fetch behind a
# small proxy for production.
VITE_8004SCAN_KEY=

# Altana on-chain sessions need NO key here — authorization is a passkey
# (WebAuthn) in the browser, and gas is relayer-sponsored on BSC testnet.
# To register a real session you only need:
#   1. a passkey-capable browser (Windows Hello / Touch ID / a security key)
#   2. the created Altana wallet funded with testnet BNB:
#      https://testnet.bnbchain.org/faucet-smart
